 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1073972",
 "html": "<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Greetings Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">It&rsquo;s time to show you the latest additions to Marvel Future Fight! This update will bring you new characters and new content! Take a look at what the update will bring.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">New additions: </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Four new characters</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">: Magik, Emma Frost, Colossus, Angel </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Two new uniforms: </span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Wolverine, Cyclops</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">New Content:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">New Faction Battle event theme</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">New Dimension Rift stage</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Adjustments:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Alliance Battle </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: #7030a0;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕; mso-bidi-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #ff6c00;\"> Four New Characters</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Four new characters: Magik, Emma Frost, Colossus, Angel have been added</span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><img src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/netmarble/mherosgb/20180320/vmhu1521528879236.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><img src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/netmarble/mherosgb/20180320/6nt71521528878540.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><img src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/netmarble/mherosgb/20180320/znjk1521528876910.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><img src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/netmarble/mherosgb/20180320/q0jk1521528877597.png\" /><br /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕; mso-hansi-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-bidi-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; color: #c00000;\">※</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: #c00000;\">&nbsp;Stats are based on skill Lv. 1</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: #951015;\">.<br /> <!-- [if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br /> <!--[endif]--></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left: 18.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 8.0pt; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings; color: #951015;\">l<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: #951015;\">Emma Frost is now available in the Emma Frost package</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left: 18.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 8.0pt; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings; color: #951015;\">l<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: #951015;\">Magik can be acquired from the new sub&#115;cription item </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left: 18.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 8.0pt; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings; color: #951015;\">l<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: #951015;\">Colossus can be acquired from the new sub&#115;cription item and also from the new Faction Battle event.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left: 18.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 8.0pt; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings; color: #951015;\">l<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: #951015;\">Angel is available in the newly added Dimension Rift &ndash; &lsquo;Fallen Angel&rsquo;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left: 18.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 8.0pt; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings; color: #951015;\">l<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: #951015;\">New team effects and level achievement goals are added with the new characters<br /> <!-- [if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br /> <!--[endif]--></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><br /> </span><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕; mso-bidi-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #ff6c00;\"> Two New Uniforms</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"> <span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\">New Uniforms for Wolverine and Cyclops have been added!</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><img src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/netmarble/mherosgb/20180320/uv9x1521529053113.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><img src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/netmarble/mherosgb/20180320/ndfc1521529052346.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left: 21.3pt; text-indent: -21.3pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings; color: #c00000;\">l<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: #951015;\">Cyclops and Wolverine&rsquo;s new uniforms have different values compared to other uniforms in the Store. They require more materials, and are given higher stat increases.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left: 21.3pt; text-indent: -21.3pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings; color: #c00000;\">l<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: #951015;\">The new uniforms will be discounted during the event period, and they can be checked in the Character Codex and Uniform tab<br /><br /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><br /> </span><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕; mso-bidi-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #ff6c00;\"> New Dimension Rift is added</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">A new Dimension Rift stage where Angel&rsquo;s X-Gene can be acquired is added.</span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"> <span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\">A newly added Comic Card can also be obtained from this stage.</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><img src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/netmarble/mherosgb/20180320/ehwe1521529108689.png\" /></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; color: #0075c8;\">- New Dimension Rift stage &lsquo;Fallen Angel&rsquo; has been added and share the same mechanics as other Dimension Rift stages!</span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><img src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/netmarble/mherosgb/20180320/p6mw1521529109505.png\" /></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #0075c8;\">- Angel&rsquo;s X-Gene and a new Comic Card can be acquired here</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><br /> </span><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕; mso-bidi-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #ff6c00;\"> Alliance Battle adjustments</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"> <span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\">Frost Beast and Meteor Fall stages have been adjusted as follows:</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -14.2pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Verdana; mso-bidi-font-family: Verdana;\">1. </span></strong><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">Changes with the Frost Beast</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">- A warning sign will be displayed prior to some of its attacks.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">- Some attacks will take longer compared to other attacks.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">- New AI pattern has been added.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -14.2pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Verdana; mso-bidi-font-family: Verdana;\">2. </span></strong><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">Changes with the Meteor Fall</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left: 21.3pt; text-indent: -7.1pt; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">-<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">There will be a short delay on the meteor fall once the meteor&rsquo;s falling position is displayed.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left: 21.3pt; text-indent: -7.1pt; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">-<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">Massive Meteor fall pattern has been added in Extreme Mode.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left: 21.3pt; text-indent: -7.1pt; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">-<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">Massive Meteor will fall in a certain interval and both the enemy and the p&#108;ayer&rsquo;s character will be affected.</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left: 21.3pt; text-indent: -7.1pt; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">-<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">A Stun effect will be applied on the p&#108;ayer&rsquo;s character, Frost Beast and other enemies when hit by the Massive Meteor.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left: 21.3pt; text-indent: -7.1pt; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo1;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\"><img style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" src=\"http://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/puble/community/GAME/futurefight_en/266/2018/03/20/1521529196549.jpg\" /></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #0070c0;\">- A Massive Meteor stuns Frost Beast and other enemies for a certain amount of time. </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-indent: 5.5pt; mso-char-indent-count: .5;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #0070c0;\">You may take advantage of this to score even higher! </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕; mso-bidi-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #ff6c00;\"> New Theme is added for Faction Battle</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; text-indent: -7.1pt;\">&lsquo;Terrigen War&rsquo; has been added in Faction Battle!</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><img src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/netmarble/mherosgb/20180320/apzd1521529226237.png\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #0075c8;\">- Meet the Inhumans fighting against the X-Men for the Terrigen Mist. </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-indent: 5.5pt; mso-char-indent-count: .5;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #0075c8;\">One side chooses to conserve it, the other wants to destroy it!</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><br /> </span><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #ff6c00;\"> New Monthly Sub&#115;cription Item and Character Package added</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">A new Monthly Sub&#115;cription Package has been added!</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">[Character Acquire] tab has been added in [Chest] menu in the store.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">1.</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;<strong>Monthly sub&#115;cription has been added.</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">It has the same mechanics as the monthly sub&#115;cription in which you will receive 20 X-Genes every day.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><img src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/netmarble/mherosgb/20180320/gmss1521529264563.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; color: #0075c8;\">- Purchased X-Gene sub&#115;cription can be claimed via the main lobby screen.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><img src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/netmarble/mherosgb/20180320/71qo1521529271427.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; color: #0070c0;\">- Along with the X-Gene sub&#115;cription, you may also purchase a Daily Biometrics sub&#115;cription by pressing the [Acquire] &#98;utton in the home screen. A new window will appear displaying the two items.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><img src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/netmarble/mherosgb/20180320/odil1521529314143.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #0075c8;\">- Colossus and Magik are exclusive characters in Daily X-Gene Sub&#115;cription</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-bidi-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; color: #c00000;\">※</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: #c00000;\"> Colossus can also be acquired from the new Faction Battle event.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-bidi-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; color: #c00000;\">※</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: #c00000;\"> Emma Frost (Emma Frost package), Magneto (X-Men Deluxe Package), Jean Grey, Cable, and Apocalypse are not included in .</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><br /> <strong>2.</strong> <strong>[Hero Chest] menu has been added to [Acquire / Upgrade Characters] menu in the Store</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">- [Chest] menu renamed to [Acquire / Upgrade Characters] in the Store</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">- Old [Acquire Character] items moved to [Hero Chest] tab</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"> <span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\">- New [Acquire Character] tab contains Characters that can be purchased with Crystals</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%;\"><img src=\"https://sgimage.netmarble.com/images/netmarble/mherosgb/20180320/s4is1521529375656.png\" /></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family